  "worked_solution": "Using the vector space axioms, we obtain the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x+y & =z+x &  & [\\,\\text{given}\\,] \\\\ (x+y)+(-x) & =(z+x)+(-x) &  & [\\,\\text{add\u00a0}-x\\text{\u00a0to both sides}\\,] \\\\ (y+x)+(-x) & =(z+x)+(-x) &  & [\\,\\text{axiom A1}\\,] \\\\ y+(x+(-x)) & =z+(x+(-x)) &  & [\\,\\text{axiom\u00a0}\\text{A2}\\,] \\\\ y+0 & =z+0 &  & [\\,\\text{axiom A4}\\,] \\\\ y & =z &  & [\\,\\text{axiom\u00a0}\\text{A3}\\,]\\end{aligned}\n$$",
